  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3541\">\n<li data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3079\">\n<p data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3017\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3015\">Normal Study:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3079\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3079\">\n<p data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3079\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">AHI &lt;5, good sleep efficiency, normal sleep architecture.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3261\">\n<p data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3119\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3117\">Obstructive Sleep Apnea (OSA):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3261\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3261\">\n<p data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3181\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">AHI &ge;5 with symptoms (or &ge;15 without); classify severity:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3261\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3202\">\n<p data-start=\"3188\" data-end=\"3202\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><em data-start=\"3188\" data-end=\"3195\">Mild:</em> 5&ndash;15</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3228\">\n<p data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3228\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><em data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3220\">Moderate:</em> 15&ndash;30</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3261\">\n<p data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3261\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><em data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3244\">Severe:</em> &gt;30 events/hour.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3410\">\n<p data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3286\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3284\">Other Findings:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3410\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3351\">\n<p data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3351\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3334\">Periodic Limb Movement Disorder (PLMD):</strong> PLMI &ge;15/hour.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3410\">\n<p data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3410\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3370\">Hypoxemia:</strong> SpO₂ &lt;90% for &ge;10% of total sleep time.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3541\">\n<p data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3541\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Results must be <strong data-start=\"3430\" data-end=\"3466\">interpreted by a sleep physician</strong>, correlated with symptoms (daytime sleepiness, snoring, witnessed apneas).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
